          "_name": "gallery03",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"gallery3\" group=\"Gallery\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n      <header>Size</header>\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n      <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n      <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n      <select title=\"Columns\" name=\"cardsWidth\">\n        <option value=\"12\">1</option>\n        <option value=\"6\">2</option>\n        <option value=\"4\">3</option>\n        <option value=\"3\" selected>4</option>\n        <option value=\"2\">6</option>\n      </select>\n      <header>Show/Hide</header>\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showTitle\" title=\"Title\" checked>\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showSubtitle\" title=\"Subtitle\">\n      <header>Cards</header>\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"autoSize\" title=\"Auto Size\">\n      <input type=\"range\" name=\"imageHeight\" title=\"Height\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\" condition=\"autoSize\">\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Spacing\" name=\"spacing\" checked>\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showCardTitle\" title=\"Title\" checked>\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showCardSubtitle\" title=\"Subtitle\">\n      <header>Background</header>\n      <fieldset type=\"background\" parallax name=\"bg\" required>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n      </fieldset>\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n      <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#edefeb\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n      <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.6\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\"></div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n      <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n        <div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n          <div class=\"mbr-section-head mb-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showSubtitle\">\n            <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\"><b>对称构图 Symmetrical Composition</b></h4>\n            <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n              To add more cards, hover on a card and click 'Add items'\n            </h5>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n          <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"item-img\">\n              <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/ezp7drpgqihehzq7v1onftj2gvggbxdngxpxyvcazbl-b65msahrnzqsay-yszeowzbwnzj-ho7wl1zvczjgdtu4xf-yaadenqtb6eyzhcixh5nkydt-plpd9diybgdorchwax-f1oaysbstn1wp7dbhdjj-aafdeqwjubpg3-2abwut2zoydtpditlgafuz.jpeg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"0\" data-bs-slide-to=\"0\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n              <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>The Draughtsman's Contract</b><br>The film often features carefully arranged spaces, architectural structures, and character positioning. It is suitable for studying the central axis and left-right visual balance.</h5>\n              <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\">\n                Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, adipiscing elit.\n              </h6>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n          <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"item-img\">\n              <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/ac4rgbzimi3ysoslswrnjadepmkomnki7skrmcc6ql6iyuvmcmcm9rcbq8-mvi-yy0qd4gvqerf0gqo9zxavo2-jo72q9p7vpjrpl0erjhkklw-vnhmba7b7x1pav-pfqsod1gsmazfnipnslko8pbbfvhmexptiqahvese8zbjgadxqjwbyc-xcticopez.jpeg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"1\" data-bs-slide-to=\"1\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n              <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>The Duke of Burgundy</b><br>The interior arrangements, furniture, and character placement can create a sense of symmetry, making the film suitable for analysing visual balance.</h5>\n              <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\">\n                Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, adipiscing elit.\n              </h6>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n          <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"item-img\">\n              <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/x-suzbyz-itpfoz8v66xmhd4yqsmj-jx-l8locc1dmokluqcxjyriiijxyb7slilmyqfuvvb3tnwwsfcgk3efl8zvscgqplnxwowzjclvdpkjmvh1koxw-wcbsbhfnphef5ur-bt597z0rhaz-2i-ocb5jwbntcg-r76h0pq4dy3s0rrlakfw9q54i5a3qw.jpeg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"2\" data-bs-slide-to=\"2\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n              <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>The Assassin</b><br>Door frames, screens, and traditional architecture create structured visual arrangements. These elements are useful for studying the balance between the centre and the sides of the frame.</h5>\n              <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\">\n                Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, adipiscing elit.\n              </h6>\n              \n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n          <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"item-img\">\n              <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/krmad2uzoqtwhp8dpdtybjnm1ysdcnslc6wu3fueuc9djtfkdecmljovfrileycybf-1ihdxay1s51vkzl-7iqm-f-rrpjz7fv-xymdzhessppv7kpiw6rio97xa4ndcxklvg-0fzcaqovkfthhnxi-2qk1kfv6zdk-pjrzblrdcpclbnuylwjizyummfywa.jpeg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"3\" data-bs-slide-to=\"3\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n              <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>A Field in England</b><br>The black-and-white imagery and character arrangements are suitable for studying the visual centre of gravity and how elements on both sides create balance.</h5>\n              <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\">\n                Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, adipiscing elit.\n              </h6>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>",
          "_cid": "vxwtlb8Vx0",
