          "_name": "gallery03",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"gallery3\" group=\"Gallery\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n      <header>Size</header>\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n      <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n      <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n      <select title=\"Columns\" name=\"cardsWidth\">\n        <option value=\"12\">1</option>\n        <option value=\"6\">2</option>\n        <option value=\"4\">3</option>\n        <option value=\"3\" selected>4</option>\n        <option value=\"2\">6</option>\n      </select>\n      <header>Show/Hide</header>\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showTitle\" title=\"Title\" checked>\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showSubtitle\" title=\"Subtitle\">\n      <header>Cards</header>\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"autoSize\" title=\"Auto Size\">\n      <input type=\"range\" name=\"imageHeight\" title=\"Height\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\" condition=\"autoSize\">\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Spacing\" name=\"spacing\" checked>\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showCardTitle\" title=\"Title\" checked>\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showCardSubtitle\" title=\"Subtitle\">\n      <header>Background</header>\n      <fieldset type=\"background\" parallax name=\"bg\" required>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n      </fieldset>\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n      <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#edefeb\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n      <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.6\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\"></div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n      <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n        <div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n          <div class=\"mbr-section-head mb-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showSubtitle\">\n            <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\"><b>顶视构图 Bird’s-eye / Overhead / Top-down</b></h4>\n            <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n              To add more cards, hover on a card and click 'Add items'\n            </h5>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n          <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"item-img\">\n              <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/pwajq1kmjmsxmt1fmgysgnxgpcwirlhg2xksao82w1psoo-d-x9mic-tkgwlmuvoj7tpzi0l-h6lz-r-3ny8opnnb1-srsgf-eg8qbit-rfcqnu-vq9svcrmdpe5zbggaryvqdcrzbqkyav71cdxokrizsqy67gupwoled1z-dxgrmnp0vljsd-3qu-7gf32.jpeg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"0\" data-bs-slide-to=\"0\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n              <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Moonrise Kingdom</b><br>The arrangement of characters and their surroundings is visually clear, making it suitable for studying how people and objects are organised when viewed directly from above.</h5>\n              <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\">\n                Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, adipiscing elit.\n              </h6>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n          <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"item-img\">\n              <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/kjrixa-fovpqczq-mgqph2us4e6fodk2bezbz8hadi6wl0erlqe16ow9et2ujgt3lvnti6rxcgvast1g4rdl5s-ceg-mnrut-mqratp9r1k8rgfi8a-dwcvgs7-vnwgna0yxypq2iwb-yah8qsnc1dxmza0pevdncychjaerct3fthjikqeagukvvvh1h0e3.jpeg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"1\" data-bs-slide-to=\"1\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n              <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>A Pigeon Sat on a Branch Reflecting on Existence</b><br><i>It</i>s static camera positions and theatrical-looking spaces are useful for observing how scene layouts direct the viewer’s attention.</h5>\n              <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\">\n                Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, adipiscing elit.\n              </h6>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n          <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"item-img\">\n              <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/qfmmcfon6soezrnzu27to1e-mfn5zqadeqcajpefptiosb5menbj-owr4icpyoqtmeq31zokghjhaogfye5vizlgjualfbxoagvewodfg9ebwu1hxwx6wpj4a-clcykstsb3x1e10z-l72dqnmylpo4iryzus1wse5uqh1roy-qiye-oz96ap8539hnmwk3f-1.jpeg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"2\" data-bs-slide-to=\"2\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n              <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>The Lobster</b><br>The deliberate arrangement of characters and spaces is suitable for studying how positioning and proportions influence the overall composition.</h5>\n              <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\">\n                Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, adipiscing elit.\n              </h6>\n              \n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n          <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"item-img\">\n              <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/hflkc07tx-fhq1-p8rirziwev5pmha2yxygcfel53n6ul3bl-m5si57zmfs7vvmgujxiuj2oz1bw-tu6dp5sudp32dfkyjvpf8jyy6kbve8-tvrspsh9b0uwcelft3gxlj7nrwo6nblczihzghvyjy8wxohwxtnbxs01bhlyvt0hhiakjf2whawbkl8nff0-.jpeg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"3\" data-bs-slide-to=\"3\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n              <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>The Neon Demon</b><br>The geometric spaces, character placement, and colour relationships are visually striking. They are useful for analysing the flat, graphic effect created by an overhead perspective.</h5>\n              <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\">\n                Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, adipiscing elit.\n              </h6>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>",
