          "_name": "gallery03",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"gallery3\" group=\"Gallery\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n      <header>Size</header>\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n      <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n      <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n      <select title=\"Columns\" name=\"cardsWidth\">\n        <option value=\"12\">1</option>\n        <option value=\"6\">2</option>\n        <option value=\"4\">3</option>\n        <option value=\"3\" selected>4</option>\n        <option value=\"2\">6</option>\n      </select>\n      <header>Show/Hide</header>\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showTitle\" title=\"Title\" checked>\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showSubtitle\" title=\"Subtitle\">\n      <header>Cards</header>\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"autoSize\" title=\"Auto Size\">\n      <input type=\"range\" name=\"imageHeight\" title=\"Height\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\" condition=\"autoSize\">\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Spacing\" name=\"spacing\" checked>\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showCardTitle\" title=\"Title\" checked>\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showCardSubtitle\" title=\"Subtitle\">\n      <header>Background</header>\n      <fieldset type=\"background\" parallax name=\"bg\" required>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n      </fieldset>\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n      <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#edefeb\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n      <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.6\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\"></div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n      <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n        <div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n          <div class=\"mbr-section-head mb-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showSubtitle\">\n            <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\"><b>引导线构图 Leading Lines</b></h4>\n            <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n              To add more cards, hover on a card and click 'Add items'\n            </h5>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n          <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"item-img\">\n              <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/tykqxdtmmxesg-mtgk2hifonxvagiydqsaeudqy9neflevwg36n2hzp4j0tfe6xr4ws76srinoqvaidqredq9kd5hz88xih2wouvxjrr8ltosz-nkhdtesjtckzqxgvjfz3hbpns31br6sc2bam6-du-vt3hpgpv4-8z7lxttao2yskfq1ccxige4tgugrm.jpeg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"0\" data-bs-slide-to=\"0\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n              <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                <b>Columbus</b><br>The edges of modern architecture, corridors, and window frames create clear lines that guide the viewer’s eyes towards the main subject.\n              </h5>\n              <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\">\n                Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, adipiscing elit.\n              </h6>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n          <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"item-img\">\n              <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/1rfbmpudtkxip99mimjmy8r-11d87mdwex-opiktpi-lva4pdmn5xrbnpvlqelivujnhvk4ies1ft0rwp-y3e3uxma3hwr2mkl4du23t8vsg9yxtxjmu4v4ndjuju7qxr-0t0t2vuqsok952zzecedzzvrg09ek1yyj5jf25iwmlgectlli1-bgef2cdfq6w.jpeg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"1\" data-bs-slide-to=\"1\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n              <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Last and First Men</b><br>Large architectural structures and repeated patterns create strong perspective lines, making the image suitable for studying depth and spatial perspective.</h5>\n              <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\">\n                Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, adipiscing elit.\n              </h6>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n          <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"item-img\">\n              <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/5yd-eihkiv85zyb6-o-arpd-szzpyjsxk26phtthgzcpiorfvkcfu7adhfol-sr658ap0djfd-njqwplfqvm7-4pivhf6hvjffjcilb1pefzsfrr1wcdcibufjyrzz6gauv-ofehb4ss6ym2vjnasu5ig4i-hmn5yf44nod2ar4w5jx4o9-35tmhd1jagitj.jpeg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"2\" data-bs-slide-to=\"2\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n              <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>The American Friend</b><br>Railway tracks, roads, or corridors can be used to create lines that draw the viewer’s attention towards a distant subject.</h5>\n              <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\">\n                Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, adipiscing elit.\n              </h6>\n              \n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n          <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"item-img\">\n              <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/mbnf9gsl4ulgtjso3vog75n-dg40waygnrjgc1wt-ke-4tmchyhcws1kql0en5xag1yjcep1pcgnuzsgzbzi-hywvtrhmhl2rpg97bed1okgvcdx3nsh9hu6wsysjdfv29xqzaw-p0dpeijy-zzp2ukjr20yzytihcuwwty3rt1ie4rjle6umenf0anhwbkk.jpeg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"3\" data-bs-slide-to=\"3\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n              <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>The Straight Story</b><br>Roads and the horizon naturally guide the viewer’s eyes into the distance, making the film useful for analysing depth and direction.</h5>\n              <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\">\n                Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, adipiscing elit.\n              </h6>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>",
