          "_name": "gallery03",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"gallery3\" group=\"Gallery\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n      <header>Size</header>\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n      <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n      <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n      <select title=\"Columns\" name=\"cardsWidth\">\n        <option value=\"12\">1</option>\n        <option value=\"6\">2</option>\n        <option value=\"4\">3</option>\n        <option value=\"3\" selected>4</option>\n        <option value=\"2\">6</option>\n      </select>\n      <header>Show/Hide</header>\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showTitle\" title=\"Title\" checked>\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showSubtitle\" title=\"Subtitle\">\n      <header>Cards</header>\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"autoSize\" title=\"Auto Size\">\n      <input type=\"range\" name=\"imageHeight\" title=\"Height\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\" condition=\"autoSize\">\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Spacing\" name=\"spacing\" checked>\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showCardTitle\" title=\"Title\" checked>\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showCardSubtitle\" title=\"Subtitle\">\n      <header>Background</header>\n      <fieldset type=\"background\" parallax name=\"bg\" required>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n      </fieldset>\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n      <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#edefeb\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n      <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.6\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\"></div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n      <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n        <div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n          <div class=\"mbr-section-head mb-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showSubtitle\">\n            <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\"><b>低角度构图 Low Angle</b></h4>\n            <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n              To add more cards, hover on a card and click 'Add items'\n            </h5>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n          <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"item-img\">\n              <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/mx1wf3s-g11nhb9ynpcxpdnmz516shuxz-uryow2plj3bjlonox0xfkt88cm-jfdqz-sjknbcgr1kpz4kydme79cuabwc8lrvz8ie6ofovunkow0nxddxcsbkw7hhpif9motwsq3yz4j3amj2uhwf79arfihyd2ii-wy-j96hhvr2g7amyks9ata-hfsy6qf.jpeg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"0\" data-bs-slide-to=\"0\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n              <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>The Green Knight</b><br>Shooting trees, buildings, or characters from a low position can emphasise height, create a sense of intimidation, and establish a mysterious atmosphere.</h5>\n              <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\">\n                Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, adipiscing elit.\n              </h6>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n          <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"item-img\">\n              <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/oyo1xfhhv1ioj5-mpodu5-c08wj8iatqa3uo5gei5zu9yuqzbbcqszba1yt1jfkte0a-syfqb0rt4lqbz1yapgn7qmit64obos14lmotwera97zal5xpacwptdj6yj-d5zfeqjurd8aweycdwdcmn14kdl9lfbao3tnssxs-wqxiupc0sch6n6oa3kwmer.jpeg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"1\" data-bs-slide-to=\"1\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n              <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                <b>November</b><br>Its distinctive black-and-white cinematography and folkloric settings are suitable for finding shots of buildings or characters viewed from below.\n              </h5>\n              <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\">\n                Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, adipiscing elit.\n              </h6>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n          <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"item-img\">\n              <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/jnqbkxehw64ztznhonrobnpzvjqxkpf6hqm0goysjlhjoe4-i8pmyq8lmrugwxa5s-tq4fdqvhsrrijbdp9ek-jaj7qtuqj4np5ni7ek-11nhfphm-itnncgbqx52dhcqz78hrklqisvn-pcev5nkdzogmeoiwiixat2ey8segonclvbnh1lxj2b2xnfogav.jpeg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"2\" data-bs-slide-to=\"2\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n              <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>The Turin Horse</b><br>Its minimalist settings and strong sense of space are suitable for finding low-angle shots and observing the proportions between the ground, characters, and background.<br><br><b><br></b></h5>\n              <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\">\n                Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, adipiscing elit.\n              </h6>\n              \n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n          <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"item-img\">\n              <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/csu-sgtd1sroqwivhofavnmhfoxrymqutpigieq0eacwq2y-axxbsle8gwvwfroafs1zlq2oip9twgtansd5fweh7lsil4am7csqstnzhr1jgqjdg6yp9f0ftndeo8ymkjol05dnyji6yqrxv7lfed5z0d5fe4a9hufifxc-nnhkepwaa454h0vbudgeofy.jpeg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title data-slide-to=\"3\" data-bs-slide-to=\"3\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n              <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Hard to Be a God</b><br>The relationship between the architecture, characters, and surroundings is visually prominent. It is useful for analysing how a low camera position can make a scene feel heavier and more imposing.</h5>\n              <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\">\n                Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, adipiscing elit.\n              </h6>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>",
          "_anchor": "gallery03-6",
          "_cid": "vxNQdYBiUq",
